@startuml
[*] --> Idle : Initial State
Idle --> RequestReceived : Video Suggestion Request Received
RequestReceived --> VideosGathered : User Identified and Video Gathering Initiated
VideosGathered --> DetailsAdded : Gathering of Additional Details Completed
DetailsAdded --> SuggestedVideosSent : Suggested Videos Ready to be Sent
SuggestedVideosSent --> [*] : Final State

@enduml
